est odds for this team’s upcoming matches and show you where you can win the most.\\\",\\\"ai_predictions_modal_title\\\":\\\"AI Predictions on OddsPortal!\\\",\\\"ai_predictions_modal_body\\\":\\\"For games from the most popular competitions (e.g. Premier League, Champions League or La Liga), we added new AI-generated predictions to suggest what to bet on. They are generated 2 days before the game starts and you can find them in the Match Detail pages – \\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\\\\\"/football/england/premier-league/\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"hover:underline\\\\\\\"\\u003echeck it out now!\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\\",\\\"ai_predictions_modal_button\\\":\\\"Check the AI Predictions\\\",\\\"all_bookmakers\\\":\\\"All Bookmakers\\\",\\\"view_review\\\":\\\"View review\\\",\\\"classic\\\":\\\"Classic\\\",\\\"crypto\\\":\\\"Crypto\\\",\\\"you_must_be_logged_in\\\":\\\"you must be logged-in\\\",\\\"promo_modal_title\\\":\\\"Play more effectively thanks to Oddsportal!\\\",\\\"we_are_saving_your_predictions\\\":\\\"We are saving your predictions\\\",\\\"mon\\\":\\\"Mon\\\",\\\"tue\\\":\\\"Tue\\\",\\\"wed\\\":\\\"Wed\\\",\\\"thu\\\":\\\"Thu\\\",\\\"fri\\\":\\\"Fri\\\",\\\"sat\\\":\\\"Sat\\\",\\\"sun\\\":\\\"Sun\\\",\\\"hot_matches_description\\\":\\\"We list most popular matches here. Find the best betting odds and bookmakers offering them easily. Click on any match to view betting odds comparison from all bookmakers. Visit our page for [[SportsBettingBonusesLink]] today and find the offers that earn you added funds to use on the most popular matches that are coming up.\\\",\\\"common_finished\\\":\\\"Finished\\\",\\\"common_fin\\\":\\\"FIN\\\",\\\"common_aet\\\":\\\"AET\\\",\\\"common_after_et\\\":\\\"After ET\\\",\\\"common_after_pen\\\":\\\"After Pen.\\\",\\\"common_pen\\\":\\\"PEN\\\",\\\"common_after_ot\\\":\\\"After OT\\\",\\\"common_aot\\\":\\\"AOT\\\",\\\"cancelled\\\":\\\"Cancelled\\\",\\\"next_matches_hide_finished