sport or having done some research beforehand.</p><p>Check out our football predictions today and discover users with huge return on investment (ROI) and their latest picks for upcoming games.</p><p></p></div></div></div></div><script>$RC(\"B:9\",\"S:9\")</script><div hidden id=\"S:a\"></div><script>$RC(\"B:a\",\"S:a\")</script><div hidden id=\"S:1\"></div><script>$RC(\"B:1\",\"S:1\")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"8e:I[525448,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1c903j7c2wxjq.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/09ofwgrl-n2ny.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2mwf68-55_ff3.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1eo-bybtoy-kv.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0zdv4izrzh6e6.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xhbtwp_h_rh8.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0li_offttbsjl.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1emz9mq3jem1q.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/336375_d-ridk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0f9pdkh8opa50.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/32x443igwm2wg.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3lfh1gt7qpfb0.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8f:I[726860,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1c903j7c2wxjq.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/09ofwgrl-n2ny.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2mwf68-55_ff3.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1eo-bybtoy-kv.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0zdv4izrzh6e6.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xhbtwp_h_rh8.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0li_offttbsjl.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1emz9mq3jem1q.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/336375_d-ridk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0f9pdkh8opa50.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/32x443igwm2wg.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3lfh1gt7qpfb0.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n90:I[944520,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1c903j7c2wxjq.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/09ofwgrl-n2ny.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2mwf68-55_ff3.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1eo-bybtoy-kv.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0zdv4izrzh6e6.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xhbtwp_h_rh8.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0li_offttbsjl.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1emz9mq3jem1q.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/336375_d-ridk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0f9pdkh8opa50.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/32x443igwm2wg.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3lfh1gt7qpfb0.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n91:T3654,\\u003ch1 style=\\\"font-size: 22px; line-height: 1;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSports Betting Predictions - Tips \\u0026amp; Betting Insights\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDiscover the latest football, basketball, tennis and many more betting predictions for other sports with OddsPortal today, made by users on our platform. Take a closer look at the percentage of users predicting the outcomes in the 1X2 market for \\u003ca href=\\\"/football/\\\"\\u003efootball betting\\u003c/a\\u003e, and uncover interesting betting opportunities, sometimes at vast odds.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eUpdated regularly to show you the latest football predictions for the next seven days based on activity by our users, our betting predictions also come combined with the latest odds from our recommended bookmakers, highlighting the best value for each prediction.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe users in our community strive to bring a high level of commitment when making their football predictions, and don\\u0026rsquo;t select any outcome without having knowledge of the sport or having done some research beforehand.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCheck out our football predictions today and discover users with huge return on investment (ROI) and their latest picks for upcoming games.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e[[ShowMore]]\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eToday\\u0026rsquo;s Betting Predictions \\u0026ndash; Overview\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe betting predictions that we offer on this page are reflective of our users, showing their view of which team or player will win the game in the selected sport shown. These user predictions could be based on many different factors, but are likely to be a result of checking form, statistics, odds movement, and other facets that go into people\\u0026rsquo;s individual analysis.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis means that the betting predictions we are showing are not expert-certified, however the highly voted outcomes can represent the public consensus, and where the value may lie in the fixture.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe\\u0026rsquo;d highly recommend that you also do your own analysis before following any football predictions that are suggested. We also suggest that you make this analysis based on what you think is the most influential consideration, which could mean looking at the statistical models and xG data, emphasis on historical records, or insights based on recent form and performance.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOn top of that, it must also be said that football betting predictions are not a guarantee, and only based on each individual tipster\\u0026rsquo;s reasoned insight.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhen you are registered with OddsPortal, which is completely free to do, you can make your own football predictions and follow your own ROI based on your selections.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFootball Predictions by League\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur football betting predictions cover many major leagues and competitions around the world, meaning you can find tips for \\u003ca href=\\\"/football/england/premier-league/\\\"\\u003ePremier League odds\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\"/football/europe/champions-league/\\\"\\u003eChampions League odds\\u003c/a\\u003e, in addition to the likes of \\u003ca href=\\\"/football/south-america/copa-libertadores/\\\"\\u003eCopa Libertadores odds\\u003c/a\\u003e, and more.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3 style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePremier League Predictions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor Premier League predictions, due to the wide coverage it receives, it is common for our users to make predictions for this league. If you have a favourite team or follow the league closely, you will be well aware of team performance, the standings in the division, injuries and squad changes, all of which will also contribute when making the decision to follow our football predictions or not.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBeing the most popular league in the world with some of the best players and teams, it is a popular league to bet on, and our user predictions can provide you with some extra insight.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3 style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eChampions League Predictions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Champions League, which is the biggest competition in Europe, is regularly featured in our football predictions too. Being a knockout tournament and the teams not playing each other as regularly, it can be extremely useful to find out the public consensus for Champions League predictions to guide your betting decisions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCheck out our page today and see whether there has been any Champions League predictions made by a pool of our users.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3 style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePredictions for Other Leagues and Competitions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor certain leagues you may be less familiar with, like the Copa Libertadores, or maybe even other major leagues in Europe, we regularly provide football tips that you can decide whether you think are \\u003ca href=\\\"/value-bets/\\\"\\u003evalue bets\\u003c/a\\u003e or not. We always recommend that rather than betting blind on these football predictions, you do a deep dive yourself to acknowledge results for form, team lineups, the league table, and other factors.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe predictions page can be seasonal, showing the active leagues or international games during the summer when major European leagues are currently having a break, which could see you find various different competitions from around the world.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor each of today\\u0026rsquo;s football predictions, you can click on them to find a selection of recent results in the competition, head-to-head results, and match facts. By combining these with your own knowledge, it empowers you to make your own football predictions too, and maybe even go against the grain regarding football tips today on this page.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eTips for Making Your Own Football Predictions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYou might be someone that is looking to make your own betting predictions, and that is absolutely fine. If that is the case, it\\u0026rsquo;s strongly recommended by us that you make an analysis of your own of each individual game you plan to bet on, or include in your accumulator bet.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis should be based on what you find to be useful information for directing your betting choices, which could be monitoring team form and the latest standings, maybe even home and away form specifically too. Meanwhile, others may prefer to look at xG and statistical data behind the standard metrics, as they aim to find a deeper understanding or deep lying metric which could switch in any upcoming game.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur site can provide you with all of the key information that we have mentioned, such as \\u003ca href=\\\"/results/\\\"\\u003eresults\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca href=\\\"/standings/\\\"\\u003estandings\\u003c/a\\u003e. Moreover, we can instruct you on some key betting markets that might be relevant, pointing out that say Arsenal have had both teams to score in 4/5 of their most recent matches through our match facts.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAdditionally, our results on OddsPortal are archived with the closing odds for each game, allowing you to decipher where bookmakers may have mispriced teams, or a team has consistently won as the underdogs for example.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIn regards to player related stats, injury reports, or xG data, you may need to find other resources to supply this information as it is not currently something our platform provides.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur football predictions are guided by users, none of which are to be considered tipsters. This means we always recommend you only bet with what you can afford, and don\\u0026rsquo;t solely rely on these predictions for your strategy when sports betting.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOnce you\\u0026rsquo;ve made your own analysis, cast your vote by clicking the prediction bar below each match for the outcome you think is most likely!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhich Bookmakers Offer the Best Odds for Today\\u0026rsquo;s Tips?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhen you click on any of our football predictions, it will add your selection to your coupon with OddsPortal, where you will then see which \\u003ca href=\\\"/bookmakers/\\\"\\u003ebookmakers\\u003c/a\\u003e are offering the best odds for today\\u0026rsquo;s tips.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe only provide you with recommendations to the best online bookmakers in your location, bringing you a selection to pick from, whilst we compare them to bring you optimal value for our chosen predictions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFurther to that, for those of you that have not signed up with any bookmakers offering the best odds for our betting predictions, you can find their welcome bonus for new players among our \\u003ca href=\\\"/bonus-offers/\\\"\\u003ebetting offers\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis means that not only can you find football betting predictions courtesy of our site, but we ensure to maintain our odds comparisons to also help you secure a value bet for each of them too.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eToday\\u0026rsquo;s Basketball Predictions - NBA \\u0026amp; NCAA (Community Picks)\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur predictions page also gives you access to our user\\u0026rsquo;s picks for different basketball tournaments around the world. By clicking on the tab, you will quickly be able to see the basketball predictions today, which could show the best \\u003ca href=\\\"/basketball/usa/nba/\\\"\\u003eNBA odds\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\"/basketball/usa/ncaa/\\\"\\u003eNCAA odds\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\"/basketball/europe/euroleague/\\\"\\u003eEuroLeague odds\\u003c/a\\u003e, or another ongoing tournament.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor example, any NBA basketball predictions that you might find will show you the percentage of users favouring the home team or away team in any individual matchup being played within the next seven days.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis can be especially helpful if you are just getting into the sport or looking to follow more than just the NBA, and want to know how other users are making their basketball predictions for today.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eJoin our users today and make your own basketball predictions below by clicking on the ratio bar below the odds, contributing your opinion.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eToday\\u0026rsquo;s Tennis Predictions - ATP \\u0026amp; WTA (User Insights)\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe tennis tab will lead you to our community\\u0026rsquo;s expectations for today\\u0026rsquo;s ATP and WTA matches, plus other tournaments if they have received enough user votes. These tennis predictions are again based on our community on OddsPortal, with the percentage pointing you towards what our users believe is the best selection.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDepending on the activity on tennis tours like the ATP or WTA, you are likely to find the latest tennis predictions for today and tomorrow, giving you several different options. Furthermore, you can also take a look through our users and filter the sport to tennis to see those who regularly make tennis predictions and their ROI.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIf you believe that the tennis betting predictions selected by users are wrong, or you strongly agree, add your predictions and make your own vote today.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOther Sports Predictions - Baseball, Hockey \\u0026amp; Cricket (Community Trends)\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur platform also offers user predictions for several other sports, which could be baseball, hockey, cricket, or something else you find interesting. All of these sports work similarly to what we have mentioned above, with you being able to click on the particular sport you are interested in and finding the betting predictions today.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis means that all of the sports available on our site may have betting predictions for today, even including some really niche options like table tennis, futsal, or similar.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo discover those who are typically very good at making predictions for these sports, you can head to the \\u003ca href=\\\"/users/\\\"\\u003eusers\\u003c/a\\u003e page and filter the sport to your preference, and discover the latest sports betting predictions for it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAdditionally, on this page you can filter for the amount of predictions made by users, a minimum ROI percentage, and more. Meanwhile, you can also even look at users active right now, popular users on our site, among other things.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFAQs\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch2 style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat Are The Most Accurate Football Predictions Today?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThere is no way of saying what the most accurate football predictions today are until the fixtures are complete. There are football predictions that may present better value than others, but the most accurate ones can only be known after the result is known.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3 style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eHow Often Are Football Predictions Updated?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFootball predictions on this page are updated regularly and showcase the top user predictions for the next seven days. You are also able to look back on the archived user predictions too, which shows how accurate they were for previous games.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3 style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAre Your Predictions Based on Expert Data or User Votes?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFootball predictions on our site are based on user votes and not expert betting tipsters. Whilst a general consensus choosing one team to win may suggest they are more likely, it is still only based on user votes and not expert data. Some of the users making football predictions may make their decisions based on data, but we can\\u0026rsquo;t say that for certain.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3 style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhere Can I Get Free Football Betting Tips?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFree football betting tips can be found on this page, based on our user predictions. Meanwhile, you can also visit our users page to find those with a high ROI, the amount of predictions they have made, and if they have any active predictions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3 style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat\\u0026rsquo;s The Difference Between Tips and Predictions?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBetting predictions are typically made by experts and will be a prediction into what they think the result will be, or maybe how many goals there will be in a football fixture. A betting tip is usually from a tipster, who will have a staking plan and specifically allocate a certain amount of points within that plan for each tip, plus ROI for all of their bets.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe best way to differentiate the two is betting tips are usually provided by experts who have done the research and have monitored the odds and market and have 100% belief in their selection, while predictions can be seen as more of an educated guess.\\u003c/p\\u003e7:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex w-full flex-col gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",null,{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:type\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"sport\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",null,{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:image\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"https://www.oddsportal.com/images/logo.png\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",null,{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:site_name\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Oddsportal.com\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L8e\\\",null,{\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"link\\\":\\\"/\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"H1\\\":\\\"Odds Portal - Betting Odds Monitoring Service\\\",\\\"scriptPath\\\":\\\"main/home\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"/community/\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Community\\\",\\\"H1\\\":\\\"Sports Betting Community\\\",\\\"scriptPath\\\":\\\"community/main\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Top Predictions\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-primary mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1 pt-2 text-sm text-gray-dark\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pt-2 font-secondary text-[22px] font-bold leading-[26px] text-black-main max-md:leading-[30px]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Top Predictions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cms font-primary text-gray-dark\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Share your bets with OddsPortal community and know what the others predict. To make a prediction just click on the ratio bar below odds. Here are the top user predictions for next 7 days.\\\"}]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L8f\\\",null,{}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L90\\\",null,{\\\"html\\\":\\\"$91\\\"}]]}]\\n18:null\\n1c:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Free Sports Betting Tips \\u0026 Predictions Today\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Get today’s sports betting predictions and free tips. Follow the most popular bets, compare odds, and spot key trends across major sports.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"author\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"LiveSport s.r.o.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"keywords\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Predictions, picks, tips, bets\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"robots\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"index,follow\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"copyright\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"(c) LiveSport s.r.o. 2007 - 2026\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"verify-v1\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Bb7e33T56Ylh3AuhM08L41r1bjNsdEchyFEqQPnK2wg=\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.oddsportal.com/predictions/\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"alternate\\\",\\\"hrefLang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.oddsportal.com/predictions/\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"alternate\\\",\\\"hrefLang\\\":\\\"pl-pl\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.oddsportal.com/pl/predictions/\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"alternate\\\",\\\"hrefLang\\\":\\\"pt-br\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.oddsagora.com.br/predictions/\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"alternate\\\",\\\"hrefLang\\\":\\\"it-it\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.centroquote.it/predictions/\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"alternate\\\",\\\"hrefLang\\\":\\\"es\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.cuotasahora.com/predictions/\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>"
